# Work artifacts: the cross-session, cross-agent handoff channel.
#
# The leading slash matters. It anchors this to the repository root, so `templates/work/`
# — which is the template and MUST stay tracked — is not caught by it.
#
# Ignored by default, per templates/work/README.md. Delete this line if you want the trail
# in history: findings.md entries about rejected approaches keep their value long after the
# work is done, and that is exactly the knowledge that is expensive to rediscover.
/work/

